    useUser/useTeslaUserOrders → ActiveOrdersSource.onUpdate(OrdersUpdate{orders,fetched_at,status,
      connection}); useRefreshTeslaOrders mutation → ActiveOrdersSource.refresh(completion:) whose
      OrdersRefreshOutcome drives the toast; useToast → ActiveOrdersToast seam; useDateFormat/
      formatDateTime → OrdersDateFormat (medium date + short time / medium date); useTranslation →
      OrdersStrings facade (P1/S10).
  Shared components mapped to native counterparts:
    GlassPanel→TSGlassPanel, IconBox→TSIconBox(cart.fill, accent/cyan), Badge→OrdersBadge(tone),
    Button→TSButton(secondary,small,isLoading), EmptyState→ContentUnavailableView, FadeIn→TSFadeIn,
    Toast→ActiveOrdersToast seam.
  States — every one renders (never a blank box):
    loading (skeleton grid) · content (adaptive 1/2-col order cards) ·
    empty-after-sync (web "No active orders found.") · empty-no-data (web "No order data yet. Click
    Refresh to fetch from Tesla.") — BOTH web empty branches reproduced as distinct phases ·
    error (QueryError-equivalent + retry) · stale (chip + ONE guarded auto-refresh, re-armed on live) ·
    offline (cached orders + chip, no refetch).
